# Keep repository text files normalized as LF so cross-platform edits remain stable.
# 统一将仓库内的文本文件规范为 LF，避免跨平台编辑时反复出现换行符告警。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch launchers keep CRLF because cmd.exe tooling is most predictable with native endings.
# Windows 批处理启动脚本保留 CRLF，降低 cmd.exe 侧兼容性风险。
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# POSIX shell scripts should always stay LF.
# POSIX Shell 脚本始终保持 LF。
*.sh text eol=lf
